<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Create a CareCycle donor or NGO account.">
  <title>Create account | CareCycle</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/defaultEntry.css">
  <script src="/accessibility.js" defer></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/ui-consistency.css"></head>
<body class="auth-page">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
  <main class="auth-shell" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><h1 class="visually-hidden">CareCycle registration</h1>
    <section class="auth-story register-story" aria-labelledby="carecycle-title">
      <a class="brand brand-light" href="/home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span>CareCycle</span>
      </a>
      <div class="story-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Donor and NGO accounts</span>
        <h2 id="carecycle-title">Create a donor or NGO account.</h2>
        <p>Donors list equipment. NGOs submit an organization profile for verification before discovering equipment.</p>
        <ul class="story-checks">
          <li>Donors review requests and decide who receives equipment</li>
          <li>NGOs need organization verification before discovery</li>
          <li>Both participants agree on pickup and record receipt</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="story-note">Organization verification does not certify equipment condition.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="auth-panel">
      <div class="auth-card">
        <div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span>CareCycle</span></div>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Join CareCycle</span>
        <h2>Create your CareCycle account</h2>
        <p class="auth-subtitle">Choose your role and enter your account details.</p>
        <% if (message) { %><div class="auth-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"><%= message %></div><% } %>
        <form action="/register" method="post" class="auth-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <fieldset class="role-picker">
            <legend>I am joining as</legend>
            <label class="role-option">
              <input type="radio" name="role" value="donor" <%= typeof selectedRole === 'undefined' || selectedRole !== 'ngo' ? 'checked' : '' %>>
              <span><strong>Equipment donor</strong><small>List and manage equipment you want to give.</small></span>
            </label>
            <label class="role-option">
              <input type="radio" name="role" value="ngo" <%= typeof selectedRole !== 'undefined' && selectedRole === 'ngo' ? 'checked' : '' %>>
              <span><strong>NGO member</strong><small>Represent an organization seeking equipment.</small></span>
            </label>
          </fieldset>
          <label for="name">Full name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Your full name" required>
          <label for="email">Email address</label>
          <input id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
          <label for="password">Password</label>
          <input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" maxlength="128" placeholder="At least 8 characters" required>
          <button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Create account</button>
        </form>
        <p class="auth-switch">Already have an account? <a href="/login">Sign in</a></p>
        <p class="auth-switch"><a href="/home">How CareCycle works</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
